    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Check LFTs b4 starting oral terbinafine (hepatotoxicity may occur ± liver dz). Periodic LFT monitoring = recommended; stop if liver inj develops."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Terbinafine inhibits CYP2D6:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " w TCAs, SSRIs, BBs, class 1C antiarrhythmics or MAO-B inhibitors, monitor carefully; the 2D6 drug may need a lower dose."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "children older than 2 years USU 10 mg/kg daily. Cont until the organism = eradicated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Lowers warfarin effect (the anticoag dose may need adjusting) and may reduce oral contraceptive effectiveness (a second form of BC may be indicated). W EToH: N/V, flushing, tachy and severe hypotension have been reported."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Prolonged therapy:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " periodic renal, hepatic and hematopoietic monitoring."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
